@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ArrowColor #4A5568
skinparam BorderColor #4A5568
skinparam BackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #A67C00
title Runtime plugin audit state
[*] --> RUNNING : core.PluginRun inserted
RUNNING --> SUCCESS : plugin completed
RUNNING --> FAILED : exception or audit failure
RUNNING --> CANCELLED : interrupted
SUCCESS --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
note right of RUNNING
Dry runs do not create core.PluginRun rows.
PluginRunStatus.DRY_RUN exists only in memory.
end note
@enduml
